From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aditya Prayoga <aditya@kobol.io>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2020 20:04:22 +0700
Subject: arm64: dts: rockchip: helios64: enable USB host0

u2phy0 host port and the EHCI/OHCI pair wired to the M.2 slot.

Upstream: sent 2026-10-11 (without phy-supply),
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20261011-b4-helios64-usb-host0-v1-1-693fe316701b@iav.lv

Split out of add-board-helios64.patch (Aditya Prayoga, rebased onto
mainline by rpardini for 6.3); the DTB content is unchanged.

Signed-off-by: Aditya Prayoga <aditya@kobol.io>
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Igor Velkov <iav@iav.lv>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399-kobol-helios64.dts | 16 ++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 16 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399-kobol-helios64.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399-kobol-helios64.dts
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399-kobol-helios64.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399-kobol-helios64.dts
@@ -776,6 +776,14 @@ &tsadc {
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&u2phy0 {
+	status = "okay";
+
+	u2phy0_host: host-port {
+		status = "okay";
+	};
+};
+
 &u2phy1 {
 	status = "okay";
 
@@ -790,6 +798,14 @@ &uart2 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&usb_host0_ehci {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&usb_host0_ohci {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &usbdrd3_1 {
 	status = "okay";
 
-- 
Armbian

